#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:458
msgid "Downloads all settings, platform IDs and event rules as a JSON file – ideal for rolling out a proven setup to another site."
msgstr "Lädt alle Einstellungen, Plattform-IDs und Event-Regeln als JSON-Datei herunter – ideal, um ein bewährtes Setup auf eine weitere Website zu übertragen."

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:459
#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:477
msgid "Note:"
msgstr "Hinweis:"

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:459
msgid "The export contains your CAPI access token in plain text. Store the file securely and never share it publicly."
msgstr "Der Export enthält deinen CAPI Access Token im Klartext. Bewahre die Datei sicher auf und teile sie niemals öffentlich."

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:474
#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:488
msgid "Import configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguration importieren"

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:476
msgid "Upload a previously exported JSON file. All values are validated and sanitised before they are saved."
msgstr "Lade eine zuvor exportierte JSON-Datei hoch. Alle Werte werden vor dem Speichern validiert und bereinigt."

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:477
msgid "The import overwrites the current settings and all event rules."
msgstr "Der Import überschreibt die aktuellen Einstellungen und alle Event-Regeln."

#: C:/Users/Seitz/Documents/Claude/lightweight_meta_pixel_and_capi_tracker/dev-tools/../lightweight-meta-pixel-capi-tracker/includes/class-lmpct-admin.php:486
msgid "Really import? The current settings and event rules will be overwritten."
msgstr "Wirklich importieren? Die aktuellen Einstellungen und Event-Regeln werden überschrieben."

#. translators: %s: URL path that is covered by both a URL event and form tracking
